OL,3,GNEWSA'Mentor helped me with lack of
OL,4,Atrust while in care'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I had a lack of trust in people," says
OL,7,FAnj Begum, who was 17 and living in a
OL,8,Fchildren's home when she was matched up
OL,9,Fwith her volunteer mentor Jess Holland,
OL,10,Fwho is five years older than her.
OL,12,F"There wasn't a lot of hope there, but
OL,13,Fthen, over time, building that
OL,14,Frelationship with Jess, getting to know
OL,15,Fher and seeing how much time and effort
OL,16,Fshe put into the relationship, it
OL,17,Fdeveloped from friends to like a
OL,18,Fsisterly bond," said Begum.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,368,360,200,160,0,100
