OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSA'Mentor helped me with lack of
OL,4,Atrust while in care'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHolland said: "When I first met her,
OL,7,Fshe was very self-conscious, very, very
OL,8,Fquiet, really struggled with confidence
OL,9,Fand trusting whereas she's just grown
OL,10,Fto be such an amazing young woman."
OL,12,FHaving become adults and moving to
OL,13,Findependent living, the bonds between
OL,14,Fseven pairs of former looked-after
OL,15,Fchildren and their mentors have been
OL,16,Frecognised in a first Lifelong
OL,17,FGuardianship Ceremony at Northampton
OL,18,FSaints RFC's stadium.
